<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<task id="074" project="field-mapping-server-write-path-r1">
  <metadata>
    <title>TrackingFieldTrio Family tool — optional onOpenFamily callback, PCF wiring, Matter/Project/WA/Event forms (FR-33)</title>
    <phase>7 W7 Record family service and Family tool</phase>
    <gate>073 complete</gate>
    <status>not-started</status>
    <rigor>FULL</rigor>
    <rigor-reason>Modifies a shared component and a PCF control (.tsx/.ts).</rigor-reason>
    <model-tier>sonnet</model-tier>
    <model-tier-reason>Follows the existing onOpenGrantModal / onOpenEmailMembers callback pattern exactly.</model-tier-reason>
    <effort>high</effort>
    <parallel-group>W7-C</parallel-group>
    <parallel-safe>true</parallel-safe>
    <deps>073</deps>
    <tags>pcf, react, fluent-ui, frontend, testing</tags>
    <estimated-effort>4-6 hours</estimated-effort>
  </metadata>

  <prompt>Add a Family icon to the TrackingFieldTrio toolbar via a new optional `onOpenFamily` callback (same pattern as `onOpenGrantModal` / `onOpenEmailMembers`), wire it in the PCF `index.ts` to render `RecordFamilyModal` for the form's record, and confirm the PCF is on the Matter, Project, Work Assignment and Event main forms.</prompt>
  <role>SPAARKE front-end developer, PCF + shared Fluent v9 components.</role>
  <goal>On all four forms the Family icon opens the Family modal for the current record; consumers that do not pass onOpenFamily render exactly as before.</goal>

  <context>
    <background>spec.md FR-33; design.md §12.3 F. The owner confirmed the PCF is already on the Work Assignment main form ({7e578eef-761d-f111-88b3-7c1e520aa4df}); verify the other three from the form XML or live metadata.</background>
    <relevant-files>
      <file role="modify">src/client/shared/Spaarke.UI.Components/src/components/TrackingFieldTrio/TrackingFieldTrio.tsx (toolbar ~:339; props ~:314)</file>
      <file role="modify">src/client/pcf/TrackingFieldTrio/index.ts</file>
      <file role="modify">src/client/pcf/TrackingFieldTrio/ControlManifest.Input.xml (version bump only)</file>
      <file role="modify">the TrackingFieldTrio component tests (snapshot / toolbar tests next to the component)</file>
    </relevant-files>
  </context>

  <constraints>
    <constraint source="FR-33">onOpenFamily is optional; absent → no icon, no layout change (existing snapshots unchanged).</constraint>
    <constraint source="ADR-021 / ADR-022">Fluent v9 icon, semantic tokens, React version as bundled.</constraint>
    <constraint source="PCF-DEPLOYMENT-GUIDE">Bump the version in every location the pcf-deploy skill's version table lists; production build `npm run build:prod` (FAILURE-MODES AP-1). Deployment is task 076.</constraint>
    <constraint source="NFR-05">Measure and record the PCF bundle-size delta.</constraint>
  </constraints>

  <knowledge>
    <files>
      <file>.claude/constraints/pcf.md</file>
      <file>.claude/patterns/pcf/control-initialization.md</file>
      <file>.claude/patterns/pcf/theme-management.md</file>
      <file>src/client/pcf/CLAUDE.md</file>
      <file>docs/guides/PCF-DEPLOYMENT-GUIDE.md</file>
      <file>.claude/skills/ui-test/SKILL.md</file>
    </files>
  </knowledge>

  <steps mode="directional">
    <step order="0">Declare FULL rigor; confirm 073 is merged.</step>
    <step order="1">Add the tests (icon shown only with the callback; click calls it; existing snapshots unchanged); confirm they fail.</step>
    <step order="2">Add the prop and icon; wire the PCF; bump version; production build; record bundle delta.</step>
    <step order="3">Verify the PCF's presence on the four main forms (read-only); record the form ids.</step>
    <step order="4">Update TASK-INDEX.md to ✅ [done]; notes in notes/task-074-notes.md.</step>
  </steps>

  <escalation>
    <trigger>If the PCF is not on one of the four main forms, STOP and ask the owner before any form change.</trigger>
  </escalation>

  <outputs>
    <output type="code">src/client/shared/Spaarke.UI.Components/src/components/TrackingFieldTrio/TrackingFieldTrio.tsx</output>
    <output type="code">src/client/pcf/TrackingFieldTrio/index.ts</output>
  </outputs>

  <acceptance-criteria>
    <criterion testable="true">With onOpenFamily the Family icon renders and clicking it calls the callback once.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">Without onOpenFamily the component's existing snapshots and tests pass unchanged.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">The PCF renders RecordFamilyModal for the form's entity logical name and id.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">Production build succeeds; version bumped in every listed location; bundle delta recorded.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">The four main forms' ids hosting the PCF are recorded in the notes.</criterion>
  </acceptance-criteria>

  <ui-tests>
    <test name="Family icon on each form">
      <steps><step>Open a Matter, Project, Work Assignment and Event record</step><step>Click the Family icon in the tracking toolbar</step><step>Check the console</step></steps>
      <expected>The Family modal opens for that record; no console errors</expected>
    </test>
    <test name="Dark Mode Compliance (ADR-021)">
      <steps><step>Toggle dark mode; view the toolbar and modal</step></steps>
      <expected>Icon and modal use semantic tokens</expected>
    </test>
  </ui-tests>

  <execution><skill>.claude/skills/task-execute/SKILL.md</skill></execution>
</task>
